msgid "Automated construction of atomic valence active spaces (AVAS)"
msgstr "原子价层活性空间（AVAS）的自动构建"

msgid ""
"Atomic valence active spaces (AVAS) as described by Knizia et al. can be "
"generated using the AVAS program. AVAS can be used in two different modes: "
"either as an independent program, or within the Hartree-Fock program using "
"the converged orbitals. The default behaviour in both cases differs "
"slightly, as described below."
msgstr ""
"如 Knizia 等人所述，原子价层活性空间（AVAS）可以使用 AVAS 程序生成。AVAS 可以在两种不同的模式下使用：既可以作为独立程序，也可以在"
" Hartree-Fock 程序中使用收敛后的轨道。两种情况下默认行为略有不同，如下所述。"

msgid ""
"Any number of ``CENTER`` directives can follow each other, and these must "
"directly follow ``AVAS``. If symmetry is used, all symmetry equivalent "
"centers are included automatically, and only one of them needs to be given. "
"If symmetry equivalent centers are explicitly given, the *atomic orbital "
"specifications* on these must be identical, otherwise an error will result."
msgstr ""
"任意数量的 ``CENTER`` 指令可以相互跟随，并且这些指令必须紧跟在 ``AVAS`` "
"之后。如果使用了对称性，所有对称等价的中心会自动包含，只需指定其中一个即可。如果明确给出了对称等价的中心，则这些中心上的\\ *原子轨道指定*\\ "
"必须相同，否则会导致错误。"

msgid "The *atomic orbital specifications* are of the form"
msgstr "*原子轨道指定*\\ 的形式为"

msgid "*[n]type*"
msgstr "*[n]类型*"

msgid ""
"where *n* is the principal quantum number, and *type* is ``s, p, d``,…. "
"Alternatively, individual components such as ``px, py, pz``, or ``d0, d1+, "
"d1-, d2+, d2-`` can also be given, and then only the specified functions are"
" used (otherwise all components are included). If the principal quantum "
"number :math:`n` is given, the :math:`n-l`\\ ’th atomic function of the "
"given type will be used (e.g., for ``2s`` the second :math:`s`-function, for"
" ``2p``, the first :math:`p` function, for ``4d`` the second :math:`d` "
"function). If :math:`n` is not given, the first function of the given type "
"is used."
msgstr ""
"其中 *n* 是主量子数，\\ *类型* 是 ``s, p, d``, …。或者，也可以指定单个分量，如 ``px, py, pz`` 或 ``d0, "
"d1+, d1-, d2+, d2-``\\ ，这样将只使用指定的函数（否则将包含所有分量）。如果给定了主量子数 :math:`n`\\ "
"，则将使用给定类型的第 :math:`n-l` 个原子函数（例如，对于 ``2s`` 是第二个 :math:`s` 函数，对于 ``2p`` 是第一个 "
":math:`p` 函数，对于 ``4d`` 是第二个 :math:`d` 函数）。如果未给出 :math:`n`\\ ，则使用给定类型的第一个函数。"

msgid "Example:"
msgstr "示例："

msgid "The optional *directives* can be:"
msgstr "可选的 *指令* 可以是："

msgid ""
"If a *startrecord* is given, the initial orbitals will be read from this "
"record. If this is not given, an atomic density guess is carried out. This "
"requires one Fock matrix calculation, which is done using density fitting."
msgstr ""
"如果指定了 *startrecord*\\ ，初始轨道将从该记录中读取。如果未指定，则执行原子密度猜测。这需要进行一次 Fock "
"矩阵计算，该计算使用密度拟合完成。"

msgid ""
"*dumprecord* defaults to 2110.2. If an existing dumprecord is given, a new "
"orbital set will be created in that record. If the record contains already "
"previous AVAS orbitals, these are overwritten."
msgstr ""
"*dumprecord* 默认为 2110.2。如果指定了一个已存在的 dumprecord，将在该记录中创建一个新的轨道集。如果该记录已包含先前的 "
"AVAS 轨道，则这些轨道将被覆盖。"

msgid ""
"If the occupations (``OCC``, ``CLOSED``) are given, they should normally "
"correspond to the HF occupations. In Molpro 2021 or later there is a subtle "
"difference in the use of these directives:"
msgstr ""
"如果给定了占据数（\\ ``OCC``\\ 、\\ ``CLOSED``\\ ），它们通常应与 HF 占据数相对应。在 Molpro 2021 "
"或更高版本中，这些指令的使用存在细微差别："

msgid ""
"If ``OCC`` is given, the occupied (or only closed-shell, see option ``OPEN``"
" below) and virtual spaces are projected independently. Projected orbitals "
"resulting from the occupied space are copied to the top of the specified "
"occupied space, and those resulting from the virtual space follow "
"thereafter. Depending on the threshold ``THR``, the total number of "
"projected orbitals can be larger than the number of target functions. This "
"happens if a target function contributes both in the occupied and virtual "
"spaces."
msgstr ""
"如果给定了 ``OCC``\\ ，占据空间（或仅闭壳层，参见下面的 ``OPEN`` "
"选项）和虚空间将独立投影。来自占据空间的投影轨道被复制到指定占据空间的顶部，随后是来自虚空间的投影轨道。根据阈值 ``THR``\\ "
"，投影轨道的总数可能大于目标函数的数量。当某个目标函数同时在占据空间和虚空间中有贡献时，会发生这种情况。"

msgid ""
"If only ``CLOSED`` is given, all orbitals (occupied and virtual) are "
"projected together, and the resulting projected orbitals follow the "
"specified closed-shell space. In this case the number of projected orbitals "
"should normally equal the number of target functions and is independent of "
"the threshold ``THR`` (unless this is very close to 1)."
msgstr ""
"如果仅给定了 ``CLOSED``\\ "
"，所有轨道（占据和虚轨道）将一起投影，生成的投影轨道位于指定的闭壳层空间之后。在这种情况下，投影轨道的数量通常应等于目标函数的数量，并且与阈值 "
"``THR`` 无关（除非该阈值非常接近 1）。"

msgid ""
"If both ``OCC`` and ``CLOSED`` are given, ``OCC`` has preference. If none of"
" them is given and option ``NELA`` is given, the number of closed-shell "
"orbitals is determined from the number of electrons minus the number of "
"active electrons (NELA) and the behaviour is as with ``CLOSED`` only. The "
"number of closed-shell orbitals in each symmetry is determined by the Aufbau"
" principle using the initial orbital energies."
msgstr ""
"如果同时给定了 ``OCC`` 和 ``CLOSED``\\ ，则 ``OCC`` 优先。如果两者都未给定但给定了选项 ``NELA``\\ "
"，闭壳层轨道的数量由电子数减去活性电子数（NELA）确定，其行为与仅使用 ``CLOSED`` "
"时相同。每个对称性中的闭壳层轨道数量由奥夫鲍原理根据初始轨道能量确定。"

msgid ""
"If neither ``OCC`` and ``CLOSED`` nor ``NELA`` are given, the number of "
"occupied orbitals is determined from the number of electrons and the MS2 "
"value (i.e. the number of open-shell orbitals in a HF determinant), and the "
"behaviour is as described for ``OCC``, except that the number of occupied "
"orbitals in each symmetry is determined by the Aufbau principle using the "
"initial orbital energies."
msgstr ""
"如果既未指定 ``OCC`` 和 ``CLOSED``\\ ，也未指定 ``NELA``\\ ，则占据轨道数量由电子数和 MS2 值（即 HF "
"行列式中的开壳层轨道数量）决定，其行为与 ``OCC`` 描述的一致，只是每个对称性中的占据轨道数量由使用初始轨道能量的奥夫鲍原理决定。"

msgid ""
"Note that the described behavior only applies if AVAS is used as independent"
" program. If it is called within the HF program (see below), the occupations"
" are as in the Hartree-Fock wavefunctions and should not be specified."
msgstr ""
"请注意，上述行为仅适用于 AVAS 作为独立程序使用的情况。如果它在 HF 程序内部被调用（见下文），占据情况与 Hartree-Fock "
"波函数中的一致，不应另行指定。"

msgid "The following *options* exist:"
msgstr "以下 *选项* 存在："

msgid ""
"A subsequent CASSCF (MULTI) calculation will automatically use the generated"
" active space (unless specified otherwise) and use the AVAS orbitals (unless"
" different orbitals are specified on a ``START`` directive)."
msgstr ""
"随后的 CASSCF (MULTI) 计算将自动使用生成的活性空间（除非另有指定）并使用 AVAS 轨道（除非在 ``START`` "
"指令中指定了不同的轨道）。"

msgid ""
"and check the occupation numbers. Orbitals with very small occupation "
"numbers or with occupation numbers close to 2.0 should then be manually "
"excluded from the active space."
msgstr "并检查占据数。然后应手动将占据数非常小或接近 2.0 的轨道从活性空间中排除。"

